    "title": "Expert Reacts to Xi, Putin Hot Mic on Organ Transplants, Longevity of Elite Officials | NTD",
    "text": "Immortality through endless organ transplants—a brief exchange between leaders of China and Russia is making headlines, with many pointing to the Chinese Communist Party's malign practice of forced organ harvesting. Chuck DeVore, chief national initiatives officer at the Texas Public Policy Foundation and author of the book \"China Attacks,\" joins NTD to react to this hot mic moment.\nExpert Reacts to Xi, Putin Hot Mic on Organ Transplants, Longevity of Elite Officials\nChuck DeVore discussed his reaction to the hot mic moment of Chinese leader Xi Jinping and Russian President Vladimir Putin talking about immortality and organ transplants.\nBy\n|\nPublished: 9/3/2025, 11:59:02 PM EDT",
